## Proposed Changes

### 1. New Module: `src/prepare_phase2_dataset.py`

#### [NEW] [prepare_phase2_dataset.py](file:///e:/Reply_agent/src/prepare_phase2_dataset.py)
Implements end-to-end extraction and partitioning pipeline:
- **`load_review_exclusion_groups()`**: Gathers all root IDs from existing manifests to blacklist them from evaluation.
- **`detect_message_language(text: str)`**: Evaluates script, stop-word frequency, and vocabulary signals to return `(is_english: bool, confidence: float, reason: str)`.
- **`is_interpretable_inquiry(text: str)`**: Validates that customer message contains interpretable support content (rejects empty/emoji-only/fragmentary turns).
- **`extract_spotify_candidate_pairs(cursor)`**:
  - Finds all Spotify outbound replies where direct parent is a customer turn (`inbound == 1` and `author_id != 'SpotifyCares'`).
  - Traces ancestor chain to root tweet using `find_root_tweet()` to identify `group_id`.
  - Collects full conversation tree with `collect_thread_tree()` for split isolation.
  - Generates model input context strictly from ancestor path using `build_model_context()`.
  - Detects quality flags (`has_url`, `private_handoff`, `external_context_required`, `suspected_multipart`, `partial_text`).
  - Applies privacy redactions (`@[CUSTOMER_HANDLE]`, `[CUSTOMER_NAME]`, `[EMAIL_REDACTED]`, `[PHONE_REDACTED]`).
- **`detect_duplicates_and_leakage(candidates)`**:
  - Normalizes customer inquiry text (strip handles, URLs, punctuation, lowercase).
  - Identifies exact duplicate inquiry clusters across distinct conversation groups.
  - Identifies near-duplicate candidates (character n-gram Jaccard similarity $\ge 0.85$).
  - Produces `results/phase2/leakage_report.json`.
- **`partition_dataset(candidates, rng_seed=42)`**:
  - Sorts candidate groups deterministically by `(group_id, target_customer_tweet_id, selected_brand_reply_tweet_id)`.
  - Shuffles with seed 42.
  - Allocates:
    - `dev` partition: 50 groups.
    - `eval_pool` partition: up to 1,000 groups (guaranteeing 0 review groups).
    - `historical` partition: target 3,000 groups.
  - Formats manifest entries and records exclusion reasons in `exclusion_summary.json`.

