### 2. Generated Data Artifacts

- **`data/processed/spotify_knowledge.jsonl`**: 3,000 historical knowledge records containing customer inquiry, ancestor context, and historical brand reply.
- **`data/processed/dev_inputs.jsonl`**: 50 development model inputs (ancestor path only; brand reply excluded).
- **`data/processed/eval_pool_inputs.jsonl`**: Up to 1,000 held-out evaluation pool inputs (ancestor path only; brand reply excluded).
- **`data/manifests/split_manifest.jsonl`**: Manifest mapping `example_id`, `group_id`, `target_customer_tweet_id`, `selected_brand_reply_tweet_id`, `partition`, `source_csv_sha256`, `seed=42`, `preprocessing_version="2.0"`, and flags.

