### 3. Generated Reporting Artifacts

- **`results/phase2/exclusion_summary.json`**: Exact counts of excluded records broken down by specific reason (`STRUCTURAL_INCOMPLETE`, `CYCLE_DETECTED`, `MISSING_PARENT`, `NON_ENGLISH`, `UNINTERPRETABLE_FRAGMENT`, `EXACT_DUPLICATE_REMOVED`, `REVIEW_GROUP_EVAL_EXCLUDED`).
- **`results/phase2/leakage_report.json`**: Exact and near-duplicate clusters, matching rules, and cross-partition overlap audit (confirming 0 overlap).
- **`results/phase2/data_summary.md`**: High-level statistical report covering partition counts, turn length distributions, quality flag frequencies, and language detection metrics.
- **`results/phase2/dev_preview.md`**: 20 formatted development examples showing target inquiry, allowed prior context, source identifiers, and quality flags (without automated labels or evaluation judgments).

