### 4. Tests: `tests/test_phase2_preparation.py`

#### [NEW] [test_phase2_preparation.py](file:///e:/Reply_agent/tests/test_phase2_preparation.py)
Comprehensive regression and unit tests using lightweight synthetic fixtures:
- `test_no_group_overlap_across_partitions`: Asserts intersection between group IDs across partitions is empty.
- `test_no_exact_duplicate_inquiry_leakage`: Asserts normalized inquiry text in dev/eval does not duplicate across partitions.
- `test_review_groups_excluded_from_eval`: Asserts none of the 61 review groups appear in `eval_pool`.
- `test_model_inputs_exclude_future_turns_and_reply`: Asserts `dev_inputs` and `eval_pool_inputs` contain only ancestor turns and never contain the brand reply.
- `test_language_detector`: Tests English detection on sample multilingual and ambiguous queries.
- `test_deterministic_reproducibility`: Re-running partitioning with seed 42 yields byte-identical split manifests.
- `test_manifest_schema_and_identifiers`: Verifies presence of all required manifest fields and standard `SpotifyCares:{group_id}:{cust_id}:{reply_id}` IDs.
- `test_existing_review_files_unmodified`: Asserts SHA256 of `review_scores.csv` and existing manifests are unchanged.

